3,1,,status,George,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
4,1,,status,Shunichi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need a logical way to allocate these spaces. I suggest we look at the actual usage and the physical layout first.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I agree. However, we should also consider the financial aspect and the costs involved in any new system.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,It would be wise to see if the current distribution is actually fair or if it's just a matter of perception.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Let's not overcomplicate it. I'm more interested in how this affects the atmosphere of the building. We don't want a war.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Mio,,I'm excited to help! But who's going to do the actual work once we decide? I want to know how much effort it takes!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Ryuji, finances are important, but the physical congestion is the immediate problem. We need data on how people actually leave in the morning.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,Data is exactly why I want to see the ledgers. We can't make a sustainable decision without knowing the budget.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,I think checking the records of who is actually using the bikes daily would be a good starting point.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@George, that sounds like a recipe for spying. I'd rather see how other buildings handle this mess.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Shunichi, that's a great idea! Let's see what the neighbors do. I also want to see the old handover files for the paperwork.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, it's not spying; it's resource management. I'll look into the morning flow and the physical layout of the rows.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will focus on the financial records. I want to see the ledger and the treasurer's handover file.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,I'll take a look at the sticker register and the association minutes to see if this has been a recurring issue.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I'll stick to the neighboring block's account and the old complaint logs. I want to see where things went wrong before.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Mio,,"Wait, @Ryuji is taking the handover file! I'll check the sticker register too, and maybe the display frame trial?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,Let's finalize our choices then. I'm set on the morning departures and the rain exposure.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I'm satisfied with my choices. The ledger and the handover file will provide the necessary financial clarity.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,George,,I will proceed with the sticker register and the five years of association minutes.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,Fine. Neighboring block's account and the complaint log it is. Let's see if we can avoid a disaster.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Mio,,Okay! I'll go with the treasurer's handover file and the trial of the supplier's display frame. I want to see the work involved!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
